    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Gnolls first appeared when hyenas devoured flesh corrupted by the Abyss. Their savagery pleased the demon lord Yeenoghu, who multiplied them and scattered them throughout the multiverse; since then they have served him with cackling glee, wreaking destruction and feeding on whatever is left. Gnoll demoniacs are berserkers born from gnolls who ritually eat flesh tainted by the Abyss. Carrying Yeenoghu’s devouring hunger, they hurl themselves into battle without caring about the odds or their own lives, and in their frenzy they even eat other gnolls.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
