        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} conjures a 30-foot Cube of magical &amp;Reference[Darkness] originating from a point it can see within 60 feet, which lasts for 1 minute or until the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s Concentration ends on it. This area is &amp;Reference[Difficult Terrain]. <em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=7XiT2GFYXUsTsU7F]], any creature that starts its turn in this area or enters it for the first time on a turn. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 8d6 average type=necrotic]] damage, and the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} or a creature of its choice it can see gains 10 &amp;Reference[Temporary Hit Points]. <em>Success:</em> Half damage only.</p>",
